  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.249\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- chore: ignore local CodeGraph index (`1543c77`)\n- docs: validate source-only SDK library boundary (#209) (`74337fb`)\n- SDKAGN-5: rename SdkDotCallSyntax to generic QualifiedCallSyntax (#208) (`3389e5c`)\n- SDKAGN: make the compiler fully SDK-agnostic (retire SdkModuleRegistry) (#207) (`2717b86`)\n- SDKLIB-6: decouple complex SDK facades (#199) (`b61f1bf`)\n- SDKLIB-5: move resource facades to package contracts (#198) (`83fc04c`)\n- SDKLIB-4: retire simple runtime facade registry mappings (#197) (`19ae611`)\n- SDKLIB-3: consolidate target intrinsic descriptors (#196) (`148defd`)\n- SDKLIB-2: materialize Portable2D source package (#195) (`a136902`)\n- SDKLIB-7: guard against SDK API name leaks (#194) (`91fb89d`)\n- SDKLIB-1: load libraries from project manifests (#193) (`7607fda`)\n- feat: add physical namespace usings (#182) (`c6bfc88`)\n- feat: add qualified physical namespace names (#181) (`da5c4b9`)\n- feat(sdk): add manifests and physical namespaces (#180) (`7578c99`)\n- feat(sdk): make SDK imports registry-driven (#179) (`7bc866d`)\n- feat(sdk): add explicit Portable2D import (#178) (`b911f15`)\n- docs(AGENTS): make PR + merge the default way to land changes into master (#177) (`93877c8`)\n- lang: signed relational comparison for i8, removing the runner's signed-velocity-wrap hack (#176) (`67b0ef6`)\n- camera: make Camera.SetPosition walk to the requested position, removing the runner double-call (`4ff92f7`)\n- Resolve RetroSharp issues 171-174 (#175) (`43737c2`)\n- runner: drop redundant trailing 'return;' from void functions (`779cbea`)\n- runner: split grab-bag HorizontalMotion enum into Direction + MotionSpeed (`3da615e`)\n- docs: fix CONTRIBUTING branch model to match reality (master, GitHubFlow) (`dd85a07`)\n- PascalCase all function names: Main entry point + user free functions (`1481f62`)\n- #157: remove lowercase facade aliases — PascalCase is the only dot-call spelling (`5fb2124`)\n- #157: emit PascalCase facades from the actor-framework lowerer (`5a99355`)\n- #157: make PascalCase static facades canonical across samples and docs (`2b72e97`)\n- #105: split WorldMap2D into portable flags + target WorldTileGrid (`dff15ed`)\n- SAL-8.9: migrate gb/nes camera.ScreenAabb collision to target intrinsics (`4607ec9`)\n- SAL-8.8: migrate gb/nes audio.Init to audio_init target intrinsic (`3261e96`)\n- docs: recommend branch/worktree workflow in AGENTS.md (`246ed78`)\n- SAL-8.7: migrate gb/nes music.Play/Stop to audio target intrinsics (`6315a93`)\n- SAL-8.6: migrate nes camera collision intrinsics (`15dfd35`)\n- SAL-8.6: validate compile-time operand integration (`cb8e99d`)\n- SAL-8.5: migrate game boy camera collision intrinsics (`dc6ba97`)\n- SAL-8.4: migrate nes sprite draw intrinsic (`c50638f`)\n- SAL-8.3: migrate game boy sprite draw intrinsic (`6318e52`)\n- SAL-8.2: add compile-time operand descriptors (`5712b1c`)\n- SAL-8.1: add compile-time operand design goldens (`3cd4c5b`)\n- feat(sdk): PascalCase Input/Sprite methods over snake builtins (#154) (`38baee2`)\n- feat(lang): adopt C# boolean semantics for flags (#153) (`e38ec0d`)\n- feat(lang): static class const groups replace enum-as-constant-bag (#156) (`ecab3a4`)\n- feat(input): add Button enum for input identifiers (#155) (`94b7683`)\n- feat(sdk): register PascalCase facade aliases (#157) (`09b958e`)\n- feat(sdk): migrate camera.SetPosition()/camera.Apply() to library-over-intrinsic (SAL-7, #151) (#152) (`9019b3b`)\n- docs(sdk): SAL-6 heavy-operations feasibility spike + go/no-go (#145) (#150) (`deb53ad`)\n- feat(sdk): migrate world.TileFlagsAt() to capability-gated library helper (SAL-5, #144) (#149) (`c8352e8`)\n- feat(sdk): migrate audio.Update() to library-over-intrinsic (SAL-4, #143) (#148) (`0a875a0`)\n- chore(samples): regenerate stale tracked Game Boy ROMs (#147) (`af1f586`)\n- feat(sdk): first SDK-as-library slice over per-target intrinsic catalog (#139) (#146) (`55bf0f7`)\n",
